# Tool artifacts created inside eval workspaces during a run. They are scratch
# state from ansible-lint and uv, not evidence, and .ansible/roles contains a
# self-referential symlink that no consumer of these results needs.
**/.ansible/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/

# The single-skill plugin the harness builds for the with-skill condition is a copy of
# skills/<category>/<name>/ at the commit under test, which git already records.
**/plugin-*/

# A finished workspace is its own git repository and carries build artifacts that run to
# gigabytes. `run_eval.py snapshot` reduces each one to a workspace.diff against the
# fixture's baseline commit, which is what gets committed. The workspaces stay here so
# `run_eval.py regrade` can still re-run the graders against them.
**/workspace/
